35,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The pattern is clear. Broad mandates fade, but narrow tools for one trade endure. We must fund the specific, not the sweeping.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"@Servas, that makes sense. My budget check shows the capital line is frozen, but the software allowance has room. We must stay within that recurring limit.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, that is good news! But my network check is scary. Half the plants lose signal all afternoon, and getting approved took six weeks!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Sakura, that signal loss explains the friction. My data shows we lose an hour daily copying records, and eleven misroutes stem from duplicate addresses.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, that daily loss is unsustainable. My findings are worse. The coordination group is unfilled, and our developers are locked until Q3.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, that confirms my fear. If the hands are missing, even the best tool fails. We must choose work that fits the current reality, not our hopes.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Asuka, that is worrying. If developers are locked until Q3, we cannot start anything heavy. I am glad the software allowance is open, but we must be careful.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Asuka, that is a huge problem! If the developers are busy, we cannot build anything new. I am worried about the timeline!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, if the developers are locked, we cannot fix the root cause. We must pick a solution that works with the current, broken workflow, not one that requires new code.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, exactly. We cannot build new code. We need a process fix that the existing two people can manage without breaking the rota.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Sakura, the afternoon signal loss is a hard constraint. We must avoid any proposal that depends on real-time connectivity at those plants.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Sakura, that signal loss is a major risk. My vendor check shows per-head licences climb with every department added. We must avoid that trap.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, per-head licences are a trap! My vendor check shows the same certificate requested repeatedly. We need a fixed-fee model to stop that noise!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, per-head costs are a leak. My data shows the real loss is manual duplication. We need a fixed-fee solution that eliminates the copying, not just licenses.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Daisuke, per-head licences are a trap. My data shows the real loss is manual duplication. We need a fixed-fee solution that eliminates the copying, not just licenses.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,"We have the constraints. Now we must see which proposal fits the narrow, enduring pattern.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I am still processing. The frozen capital line means we must rely on the recurring allowance. I will wait for the candidates.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I am excited to see the candidates! I hope one of them solves the signal and certificate mysteries without needing new code.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I am waiting for the candidates. The data points to a process fix, not a new build.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
